{
  "id": "yawn-vo-01",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "看完这条，你有一半的概率，会打一个哈欠。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01.mp3",
      "bytes": 61065,
      "heard": "看完这条,你有一半的概率会打得哈浅",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "name": "02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "不信？先忍住。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02.mp3",
      "bytes": 29300,
      "heard": "不信 先忍住",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "name": "03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一九八六年的实验：录像里的人，十秒打一个哈欠，连放五分钟。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "03.mp3",
      "bytes": 98263,
      "heard": "1986年的實驗錄像裡的人10秒打一個哈欠連放5分鐘",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 6.08
    },
    {
      "name": "04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "结果，百分之五十五的人，跟着打了。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "04.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "結果55%的人跟著打了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "换成微笑的录像，只有百分之二十一。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "05.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "換成微笑的錄像,只有21%",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "更怪的是：把录像里的嘴挡掉，照样传染。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "06.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "更怪的是把錄像裡的嘴擋掉照樣傳染",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "只留一张嘴，反而不太管用。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "07.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "只留一張嘴反而不太管用",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "传染你的不是那张嘴，是整张哈欠脸。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "08.mp3",
      "bytes": 67752,
      "heard": "傳染你的不是那張嘴是整張哈欠臉",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.16
    },
    {
      "name": "09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "甚至不用看：光读一篇讲哈欠的文章，就有四分之一以上的人真打了。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09.mp3",
      "bytes": 99517,
      "heard": "甚至不用看光读一篇讲哈欠的文章就有四分之一以上的人真打了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 6.16
    },
    {
      "name": "10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "比如，你正在读的字幕。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "10.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "比如你正在读的字幕",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "狗也会中招：二十九只狗看人打哈欠，二十一只跟着打了。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "11.mp3",
      "bytes": 93247,
      "heard": "狗也會中招29隻狗看人打哈欠21隻跟著打了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.76
    },
    {
      "name": "12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "四岁以下的小孩，反而基本不会。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "12.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "四岁以下的小孩反而基本不会",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "而且越亲越容易中招：家人最快，然后是朋友、熟人，最后才是陌生人。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "13.mp3",
      "bytes": 117489,
      "heard": "而且越親越容易中招家人最快然後是朋友熟人最後才是陌生人",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 7.28
    },
    {
      "name": "14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那没被传染，是不是冷血？不是。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "14.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "那没被传染是不是冷血不是",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "三百二十八人的测试里，三分之一的人一个没打，和同理心分数无关。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "15.mp3",
      "bytes": 93247,
      "heard": "328人的测试里三分之一的人一个没打和同理性分数无关",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 5.76
    },
    {
      "name": "16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "至于为什么会传染，科学家还没有定论。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "16.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "至於為什麼會傳染科學家還沒有定論",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "所以，把这条发给你最亲的人，看他撑到第几秒。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "17.mp3",
      "bytes": 74021,
      "heard": "所以把這條發給你最親的人看他撐到第幾秒",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "name": "18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你没打？那再看一遍。",
      "voice": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "voice_id": "vZZLclMx4wouUtKBRfZn",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "18.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "你沒打?那再看一遍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.48
    }
  ],
